{"seq":1,"slug":"data-warehouse-fundamentals","title":"数据仓库基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-engineering-pipelines/data-storage-architecture/data-warehouse-fundamentals","wordCount":2020,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"数据仓库基础\">数据仓库基础</h1><p>二十年前 Bill Inmon 把数据仓库定义成「面向主题、集成、随时间变化且非易失」的数据集合，那套定义放到 2026 年依然成立，但承载它的硬件早已换了三代。今天讨论数据仓库，绕不开一个事实：存储与计算彻底分离、对象存储成了事实底座、而仓库与数据湖之间那条曾经泾渭分明的边界，正在被开放表格式抹平。本文从「为什么需要一个独立于业务库的分析底座」讲起，落到 2026 年真正在生产里跑的架构选型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>数据仓库不是「另一个更大的数据库」。业务系统用的联机事务处理（OLTP）库为高并发的单行读写优化——下一笔订单、改一个用户字段；而仓库服务的是联机分析处理（OLAP）——扫一亿行算上季度毛利。两者的访问模式正交，硬塞进同一套引擎只会两头不讨好。这就是为什么需要把分析负载从生产库里剥出来，沉淀成一个专门的分析底座。</p>\n<p>下图是一个典型的现代数据仓库分层数据流，数据从源头流向消费端：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[业务库 OLTP&lt;br/&gt;MySQL/PostgreSQL] --&gt; B[抽取与加载&lt;br/&gt;ELT 管道]&#10;  C[日志与事件&lt;br/&gt;Kafka/埋点] --&gt; B&#10;  D[第三方 SaaS&lt;br/&gt;API/CSV] --&gt; B&#10;  B --&gt; E[原始层 Bronze&lt;br/&gt;对象存储原貌落地]&#10;  E --&gt; F[清洗整合层 Silver&lt;br/&gt;去重/标准化/历史化]&#10;  F --&gt; G[消费层 Gold&lt;br/&gt;维度模型/数据集市]&#10;  G --&gt; H[BI 报表&lt;br/&gt;Tableau/Power BI]&#10;  G --&gt; I[即席分析&lt;br/&gt;SQL 查询]&#10;  G --&gt; J[特征供给&lt;br/&gt;机器学习]\">flowchart TD\n  A[业务库 OLTP&lt;br/&gt;MySQL/PostgreSQL] --&gt; B[抽取与加载&lt;br/&gt;ELT 管道]\n  C[日志与事件&lt;br/&gt;Kafka/埋点] --&gt; B\n  D[第三方 SaaS&lt;br/&gt;API/CSV] --&gt; B\n  B --&gt; E[原始层 Bronze&lt;br/&gt;对象存储原貌落地]\n  E --&gt; F[清洗整合层 Silver&lt;br/&gt;去重/标准化/历史化]\n  F --&gt; G[消费层 Gold&lt;br/&gt;维度模型/数据集市]\n  G --&gt; H[BI 报表&lt;br/&gt;Tableau/Power BI]\n  G --&gt; I[即席分析&lt;br/&gt;SQL 查询]\n  G --&gt; J[特征供给&lt;br/&gt;机器学习]</pre><p>仓库、数据湖、湖仓三者的边界在 2026 年已显著收窄。按 <a href=\"https://clickhouse.com/resources/engineering/top-5-cloud-data-warehouses\">ClickHouse 的 2026 云数仓盘点</a> 与 <a href=\"https://promethium.ai/guides/data-lakehouse-vs-data-warehouse-vs-data-fabric-2026/\">Promethium 的架构对比</a> 的口径，可整理为下表：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>传统数据仓库</th>\n<th>数据湖</th>\n<th>湖仓（Lakehouse）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>存储数据</td>\n<td>结构化、建模后</td>\n<td>原始文件、任意格式</td>\n<td>原始文件 + 表管理层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存储格式</td>\n<td>多为专有列存</td>\n<td>Parquet/ORC 裸文件</td>\n<td>开放表格式（Iceberg/Delta）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计算与存储</td>\n<td>早期耦合，现已分离</td>\n<td>天然分离</td>\n<td>分离</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据治理</td>\n<td>强 schema、强事务</td>\n<td>弱、易成「数据沼泽」</td>\n<td>表层补回 ACID 与 schema</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型代表</td>\n<td>Teradata、早期 Redshift</td>\n<td>S3 + Hive</td>\n<td>Databricks、Snowflake Iceberg 表</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"存算分离-现代仓库的地基\">存算分离：现代仓库的地基</h2><p>把 Snowflake 与上一代 MPP 仓库区分开的，正是存算分离这一架构决断。<a href=\"https://clickhouse.com/resources/engineering/top-5-cloud-data-warehouses\">ClickHouse 的盘点</a> 把它描述为「多集群共享数据」架构：所有数据落在统一的对象存储层，计算以「虚拟仓库」形式按需弹起、用完即停，互不抢资源。这带来三个直接后果。</p>\n<p>其一，弹性。报表团队和数据科学团队各自跑一个虚拟仓库，彼此不会因为对方一条慢查询而排队。其二，成本可控。计算按秒计费、空闲自动挂起，不再为「以防万一」常驻一套大集群。其三，存储几乎无限且廉价——对象存储的单价远低于挂在计算节点上的本地 SSD。</p>\n<p>设存储成本为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、计算成本为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，传统耦合架构下两者必须按峰值同步扩容，总成本近似 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = k \\cdot \\max(L_s, L_c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 分别是存储与计算负载；而存算分离后两者独立扩缩，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = \\alpha L_s + \\beta L_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，在存储远大于计算的分析场景里通常显著更省。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据建模-维度建模与奖牌架构\">数据建模：维度建模与奖牌架构</h2><p>仓库里的数据怎么组织，决定了查询好不好写、跑得快不快。Ralph Kimball 的维度建模——把数据拆成「事实表」（记录可度量的事件，如一笔交易）与「维度表」（描述事件的上下文，如商品、门店、时间）——至今仍是消费层的主流。其经典形态星型模型直观、易懂、性能好；<a href=\"https://www.integrate.io/blog/mastering-data-warehouse-modeling/\">Integrate.io 的建模指南</a> 指出 Tableau、Power BI、Looker 等 BI 工具的查询生成器、缓存与下钻 UI 都是围绕星型模型的事实-维度连接假设来设计的。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  F[事实表 销售&lt;br/&gt;金额/数量/外键] --&gt; D1[维度 商品&lt;br/&gt;类目/品牌]&#10;  F --&gt; D2[维度 门店&lt;br/&gt;城市/区域]&#10;  F --&gt; D3[维度 时间&lt;br/&gt;日/周/季]&#10;  F --&gt; D4[维度 客户&lt;br/&gt;等级/渠道]\">graph TD\n  F[事实表 销售&lt;br/&gt;金额/数量/外键] --&gt; D1[维度 商品&lt;br/&gt;类目/品牌]\n  F --&gt; D2[维度 门店&lt;br/&gt;城市/区域]\n  F --&gt; D3[维度 时间&lt;br/&gt;日/周/季]\n  F --&gt; D4[维度 客户&lt;br/&gt;等级/渠道]</pre><p>但维度模型回答不了「原始数据从哪来、中间出了什么问题」。于是奖牌架构（Medallion）成为组织整条流水线的范式。按 <a href=\"https://www.databricks.com/blog/data-warehouse-design\">Databricks 的数仓设计指南</a> 与 <a href=\"https://www.dataengineeringweekly.com/p/revisiting-medallion-architecture-760\">Data Engineering Weekly 的复盘</a>，它把数据旅程切成三层，让数据质量在每一段都显式可见：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Bronze（铜）</strong>：源数据原貌落地，不做任何清洗，作为可重放的真相源；</li>\n<li><strong>Silver（银）</strong>：清洗、去重、标准化、历史化，常用 Data Vault 处理变更追踪；</li>\n<li><strong>Gold（金）</strong>：转成性能优化的维度模型与数据集市，直接喂报表和模型。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>2026 年的一个共识是：两者不是竞争关系。Silver 层用 Data Vault 做整合与历史化，Gold 层用星型模型做消费，是被反复推荐的组合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"开放表格式-抹平湖与仓的关键一跃\">开放表格式：抹平湖与仓的关键一跃</h2><p>让仓库与湖的边界真正塌缩的，是开放表格式，而 Apache Iceberg 是 2026 年的事实赢家。它在裸 Parquet 文件之上补回了 ACID 事务、schema 演进、时间旅行与隐藏分区，让「躺在自己 S3 桶里的文件」也能像仓库表一样被严肃查询。<a href=\"https://textql.com/wiki/apache-iceberg\">TextQL 的生态条目</a> 称 2025 年几乎每一个大型湖仓部署不是已用 Iceberg、就是在迁往 Iceberg。</p>\n<p>三大平台的姿态在 2026 年高度趋同：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Snowflake</strong>：把 Iceberg 表做成一等公民，可直接读写客户自有 S3/ADLS 上的 Iceberg 表，实现真正的数据可移植、摆脱锁定。据 <a href=\"https://atlan.com/know/snowflake/apache-iceberg-v3/\">Atlan 的 Iceberg v3 指南</a>，Iceberg v3 规范已于 2026 年 5 月 7 日在 Snowflake 上正式可用。</li>\n<li><strong>Databricks</strong>：通过 UniForm 让一张 Delta Lake 表同时是合法的 Iceberg 表——「写一次 Delta，可被 Snowflake、BigQuery、Trino 等任意 Iceberg 引擎读取」，见 <a href=\"https://www.databricks.com/blog/announcing-full-apache-iceberg-support-databricks\">Databricks 官方博客</a>；Iceberg v3 也已在 Databricks Runtime 18.0+ 进入公开预览。</li>\n<li><strong>BigQuery</strong>：通过 BigLake 支持基于 Iceberg 的表。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>产业层面，<a href=\"https://www.kai-waehner.de/blog/2026/03/26/dbt-meets-apache-flink-one-workflow-for-data-engineers-on-snowflake-bigquery-databricks-and-confluent/\">Kai Waehner 的分析</a> 与多方报道都提到，Databricks 在 2024–2025 年收购了 Iceberg 创始团队所在的 Tabular，进一步坐实了「行业收敛到开放表格式、而非单厂商锁定」的走向。</p>\n<h2 id=\"选型与成本-三大平台怎么算账\">选型与成本：三大平台怎么算账</h2><p>平台选型最终落到计费模型上，而三家的账单结构截然不同——这往往比基准跑分更影响真实开销。按 <a href=\"https://mammoth.io/blog/snowflake-pricing/\">Snowflake 定价指南</a>、<a href=\"https://www.owox.com/blog/articles/databricks-pricing\">Databricks 定价</a> 与 <a href=\"https://www.getmonetizely.com/articles/how-do-databricks-snowflake-and-bigquery-pricing-models-compare-for-enterprise-data-teams\">Monetizely 的对比</a>，2026 年的大致口径如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>平台</th>\n<th>计费单位</th>\n<th>价格区间（2026）</th>\n<th>账单结构</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Snowflake</td>\n<td>信用（credit）</td>\n<td>标准 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>企业</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2 / 企业</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2/</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">企业</span></span></span></span></span>3 / 关键业务 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mtext>每信用；存储</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4 每信用；存储</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">每信用；存储</span></span></span></span></span>23–40/TB/月</td>\n<td>计算与基础设施打包成一张账单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BigQuery</td>\n<td>扫描量 / 槽位</td>\n<td>按需 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>B</mi><mtext>（每月首</mtext><mn>1</mn><mi>T</mi><mi>B</mi><mtext>免费）；扁平</mtext><mn>100</mn><mtext>槽约</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5/TB（每月首 1TB 免费）；扁平 100 槽约</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（每月首</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">免费）；扁平</span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">槽约</span></span></span></span></span>2000/月起</td>\n<td>单张账单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Databricks</td>\n<td>DBU + 云资源</td>\n<td>DBU <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.15</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>0.40</mn><mtext>（模型服务低至</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.15–0.40（模型服务低至</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.15–0.40</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（模型服务低至</span></span></span></span></span>0.07，全功能计算高至 $0.75）；另叠加 EC2/Azure VM</td>\n<td>两张账单，云基础设施可再加 50–200%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 为单位时间查询量、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 为单价，则 BigQuery 按需模式下成本近似 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = p \\cdot \\sum_i s_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 条查询扫描的字节数），对扫描敏感；Snowflake 与 Databricks 则近似 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = p \\cdot t \\cdot n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 为虚拟仓库运行时长、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 为节点规模），对「开着没关」敏感。这条差异决定了优化方向：BigQuery 重在裁剪扫描列与分区，仓库类重在自动挂起空闲计算。</p>\n<p>选型上一个可操作的经验是：BI 与 SQL 重度、团队 SQL 能力强 → 偏 Snowflake 的仓库一体化体验；机器学习与流批一体重度、要数据所有权 → 偏 Databricks 湖仓；已在 Google 生态、要 serverless 免运维 → 偏 BigQuery。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>数据仓库的本质是把 OLAP 分析负载从 OLTP 业务库剥离，沉淀成面向主题、集成、可追溯的分析底座；</li>\n<li>存算分离是现代仓库的地基，让存储与计算独立弹缩，在存储远大于计算的场景里显著省钱；</li>\n<li>维度建模（星型模型）负责消费层的好查好用，奖牌架构（Bronze/Silver/Gold）负责让整条流水线的数据质量显式可见，二者互补而非竞争；</li>\n<li>开放表格式（Apache Iceberg，2026 年 v3）抹平了湖与仓的边界，Snowflake、Databricks、BigQuery 三家已高度趋同地支持它，数据可移植性成为现实；</li>\n<li>平台选型最终落到计费模型：Snowflake/Databricks 按计算时长计费、对「空转」敏感，BigQuery 按扫描量计费、对「扫得多」敏感，优化方向随之不同。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"数据仓库基础","id":"数据仓库基础"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"存算分离：现代仓库的地基","id":"存算分离-现代仓库的地基"},{"level":2,"text":"数据建模：维度建模与奖牌架构","id":"数据建模-维度建模与奖牌架构"},{"level":2,"text":"开放表格式：抹平湖与仓的关键一跃","id":"开放表格式-抹平湖与仓的关键一跃"},{"level":2,"text":"选型与成本：三大平台怎么算账","id":"选型与成本-三大平台怎么算账"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"数据摄取模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-engineering-pipelines/data-pipeline-foundations/data-ingestion-patterns"},"next":{"title":"数据湖与湖仓一体","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-engineering-pipelines/data-storage-architecture/data-lake-and-lakehouse"}}